# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
# The hero kits — the file a creator actually edits.
#
# Every sentence below compiles to the IR in src/ir.ts, and from there
# two ways: the interpreter in src/english/runtime.ts runs it directly,
# and src/english/codegen.ts prints it as the TypeScript committed in
# src/generated/abilities.gen.ts. Both run the same battle.
#
# Nothing in this file names a class, a function or an id.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------

# ----------------------------- Mountain King -------------------------

Ability Storm Bolt
Targeting: target enemy unit
Cooldown 7 seconds
Cost 75 mana
Range 600
Deal 180 damage to the target and add Stunned to the target.

Ability Thunder Clap
Targeting: no target
Cooldown 9 seconds
Cost 75 mana
Deal 100 damage to all enemy units within 300 range of this unit.
Add Slowed to all enemy units within 300 range of this unit.

Ability Avatar
Targeting: no target
Cooldown 30 seconds
Cost 125 mana
Add Avatar Form to this unit.

# ----------------------------- Shadow Hunter -------------------------

Ability Healing Wave
Targeting: target ally unit
Cooldown 6 seconds
Cost 65 mana
Range 700
Heal the target for 215.

Ability Rejuvenation
Targeting: target ally unit
Cooldown 8 seconds
Cost 65 mana
Range 700
Add Rejuvenating to the target.

Ability Carrion Swarm
Targeting: target point
Cooldown 9 seconds
Cost 110 mana
Range 700
Deal 90 damage to all enemy units within 220 range of the target point.

Ability Raise Dead
Targeting: no target
Cooldown 22 seconds
Cost 95 mana
Summon 2 Skeleton Warrior near this unit.

# ------------------------------- passives ----------------------------

# A passive has no Targeting and no cost — it is only its trigger.
Ability Cleave
Whenever this unit attacks, deal damage equal to 30% of this unit's attack damage to all enemy units within 150 range of the victim.

Ability Thorns Aura
Whenever this unit takes damage, deal 25 damage to the attacker.

Ability Envenomed Spears
Whenever this unit attacks, add Poisoned to the victim.

# A finishing blow: only fires on a kill, and only heals what is hurt.
Ability Feast
Whenever this unit kills a unit, heal all ally units within 400 range of this unit with hp below 60% for 60.

# -------------------------- demonstration only -----------------------
# Not in any unit's kit; here to show the rest of the grammar.

Ability Blink
Targeting: target point
Cooldown 10 seconds
Cost 40 mana
Range 700
Teleport this unit to the target point.

Ability War Stomp
Targeting: no target
Cooldown 12 seconds
Cost 90 mana
Push all enemy units within 250 range of this unit back 130 units.
Add Stunned to all enemy units within 250 range of this unit.

Ability Execute
Targeting: target enemy unit
Cooldown 15 seconds
Cost 50 mana
Range 500
Kill the target with hp below 15%.

Ability Delayed Blast
Targeting: target point
Cooldown 14 seconds
Cost 80 mana
Range 700
After 2 seconds, deal 260 damage to all enemy units within 180 range of the target point.

# --------------------------------- buffs -----------------------------

Buff Stunned
Duration 3 seconds
Cannot move.
Cannot attack.
Cannot cast.

Buff Slowed
Duration 6 seconds
Reduce movement speed by 50%.
Reduce attack speed by 25%.

Buff Poisoned (stacks)
Duration 8 seconds
Every 1 second, deal 4 damage to this unit.

Buff Rejuvenating
Duration 12 seconds
Every 1 second, heal this unit for 22.

Buff Avatar Form
Duration 15 seconds
Increase attack damage by 20.
Increase armor by 5.
Reduce movement speed by 15%.
